2019t care about keeping track of all his/her follower Humans. Who said DB associations were boring?","topics":[],"score":183530,"global_rank":398502},{"name":"justinfaulkner/mog_simulator","owner":"justinfaulkner","html_url":"https://github.com/justinfaulkner/mog_simulator","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Ruby","description":"A simulator for a board game I'm designing called Ministry of Green","topics":[],"score":183528,"global_rank":398510},{"name":"cyberfox/healthtrak","owner":"cyberfox","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberfox/healthtrak","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Ruby","description":"iOS health stat tracker (blood pressure, weight, glucose, etc.)","topics":[],"score":183522,"global_rank":398522},{"name":"ColetteIsabella/Beewatcher","owner":"ColetteIsabella","html_url":"https://github.com/ColetteIsabella/Beewatcher","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Ruby","description":null,"topics":[],"score":183522,"global_rank":398526},{"name":"ColetteIsabella/question_app","owner":"ColetteIsabella","html_url":"https://github.com/ColetteIsabella/question_app","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Ruby","description":null,"topics":[],"score":183522,"global_rank":398527},{"name":"MargeRosen/webdev_quest","owner":"MargeRosen","html_url":"https://github.com/MargeRosen/webdev_quest","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Ruby","description":null,"topics":[],"score":183522,"global_rank":398529},{"name":"ikangiec/bugtracker","owner":"ikangiec","html_url":"https://github.com/ikangiec/bugtracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Ruby","description":"A bug tracking system for You-Name-It homework (Code Fellows)","topics":[],"score":183522,"global_rank":398532},{"name":"SleepyBrett/homebrew-tap","owner":"SleepyBrett","html_url":"https://github.com/SleepyBrett/homebrew-tap","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Ruby","description":"Brews f